Package: mcartest
Type: Package
Title: Testing the Missing Completely at Random Assumption for Functional Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
      person("Lukas", "Stank", 
             email = "lukas.stank@campus.lmu.de", 
             role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides asymptotic and bootstrap-based hypothesis tests 
    for the Missing Completely At Random (MCAR) assumption in 
    partially observed functional data. Implements the mean comparison 
    tests and simultaneous confidence bands as proposed in Ofner, Hörmann, 
    Kraus, and Liebl (2025).
